WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.810
I think of a number, double it, and add 5.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.690
I get 17.

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:09.370
What was my number?

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.020
Call it n.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.540
2n + 5 = 17.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:18.170
Take away 5: 2n is 12.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:21.013
Halve: n is 6.
